Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(branding): white-label control center as HiTechPay

- add HiTechPay logo/icon/favicon under public/hyperswitch/assets/hitechpay
  (served at /assets/hitechpay/...) and use them as built-in defaults for
  the favicon, sidebar/header logo and login/invite screens
- config.toml: point logo_url/favicon_url at the brand assets
- theme.json + ThemeProvider fallback theme: HiTechPay primary, sidebar
  and button colours
- replace user-visible "Hyperswitch"/"Hyperswitch Control Center" strings
  with "HiTechPay"/"HiTechPay Dashboard"; page title and index.html title
- point user-facing help links to docs.hitechpay.vn and legal/blog links
  to hitechpay.vn; API hosts, identifiers and config keys are unchanged

Generated by tools/whitelabel.py.

